description":"When Iuno is in Lunar Cycle, DMG dealt by Moonbow - Basic Attack, Resonance Skill - Arc Beyond the Edge, and Moonbow - Dodge Counter is Amplified by 65%.\nWithin a certain period after performing Moonbow - Basic Attack or  Moonbow - Dodge Counter, casting Resonance Skill - Arc Beyond the Edge does not reset the cycle of Moonbow - Basic Attack.","params":["65%"]},{"index":4,"name":"Rainy Season Dwell in My Eyes","description":"Casting Heavy Attack - Absolute Fullness grants a Shield equal to 160% of Iuno's ATK to all Resonators in the team for 30s, which cannot be passed on to the incoming Resonator.","params":["160%","30"]},{"index":5,"name":"A Thousand Futile Glimpses","description":"Iuno gains 20% Resonance Liberation DMG Bonus.","params":["20%"]},{"index":6,"name":"I Am the Constant in the Chaos","description":"The DMG Multiplier of Heavy Attack - Absolute Fullness is increased by 1600%. Upon casting this skill, Iuno re-enters Lunar Cycle - New Moon, gains 100 points of Sentience, and resets all the cooldown of Resonance Skill - Arc Beyond the Edge.","params":["1600%","100"]}],"model":"basic","provenance":{"source":"encore","sourceId":"character/1410.json","verified":false}}
